[14.331, "o", "would import 5 of Conductor's conversations:\r\n\r\n  Add coupon codes to checkout  (Claude Code, 4 messages, storefront · ada/coupon-codes)\r\n    id 0199f1c2-3a10-7b4e-9c21-4f8a2d6e1b01\r\n    would resume in Claude Code\r\n  Tests for the coupon validator  (Codex, 4 messages, storefront · ada/coupon-codes)\r\n    id 0199f1c2-9e44-7f02-8a6b-1c3d5e7f9a02\r\n    as Markdown: Codex conversations come over as Markdown for now\r\n      ~/.config/conch/imports/conductor/storefront/tests-for-the-coupon-validator-0199f1c2.md\r\n  Cart badge keeps the old count  (Claude Code, 4 messages, storefront · ada/cart-badge)\r\n    id 0199f4a8-0b17-7c3d-b5e9-2a4c6e8f0d03\r\n    would resume in Claude Code\r\n  The product grid squeezes to one narrow column on small phones. Two columns below 400px, please.  (Claude Code, 2 messages, storefront · ada/cart-badge)\r\n    id 0199f4a8-7d52-7a19-8e0c-6b8d0f2a4c04\r\n    would resume in Claude Code\r\n  Rewrite the pricing page copy  (Clau"]
[14.331, "o", "de Code, 4 messages, marketing-site · ada/pricing-copy, worktree and repository gone)\r\n    id 0199f7b0-5a2c-7e81-a3d7-0c2e4a6c8e06\r\n    as Markdown: Claude Code cannot resume it: no folder to resume it in: its workspace and repository are both gone\r\n      ~/.config/conch/imports/conductor/marketing-site/rewrite-the-pricing-page-copy-0199f7b0.md\r\n\r\nconch import conductor without -n imports them; -ids ID,… only those.\r\n"]
