[19.872, "o", "imported 4 of Conductor's conversations:\r\n\r\n  Add coupon codes to checkout  (Claude Code, 4 messages, storefront · ada/coupon-codes)\r\n    resumes in Claude Code: conch new -agent claude -cwd ~/conductor/workspaces/storefront/lisbon -- --resume 35e9264f-f051-44bd-be27-ee53e7966321\r\n  Tests for the coupon validator  (Codex, 4 messages, storefront · ada/coupon-codes)\r\n    as Markdown: Codex conversations come over as Markdown for now\r\n      ~/.config/conch/imports/conductor/storefront/tests-for-the-coupon-validator-0199f1c2.md\r\n  Cart badge keeps the old count  (Claude Code, 4 messages, storefront · ada/cart-badge)\r\n    resumes in Claude Code: conch new -agent claude -cwd ~/conductor/workspaces/storefront/kyoto -- --resume a4ca55ab-36ea-414e-9906-f86dac5f9ce0\r\n  Rewrite the pricing page copy  (Claude "]
[19.872, "o", "Code, 4 messages, marketing-site · ada/pricing-copy, worktree and repository gone)\r\n    as Markdown: Claude Code cannot resume it: no folder to resume it in: its workspace and repository are both gone\r\n      ~/.config/conch/imports/conductor/marketing-site/rewrite-the-pricing-page-copy-0199f7b0.md\r\n\r\nTo carry on from a Markdown copy, start an agent where it ran and point it at the file:\r\n\r\n  conch new -agent codex -cwd ~/conductor/workspaces/storefront/lisbon -- 'Read ~/.config/conch/imports/conductor/storefront/tests-for-the-coupon-validator-0199f1c2.md and carry on from where it leaves off.'\r\n\r\nOr drag the file into the agent's prompt, in conch or Conch.app.\r\n\r\nIn conch now, with their conversations under the branches' sessions:\r\n  storefront  "]
[19.872, "o", "~/src/storefront\r\n"]
